// precTerm(raw, list) — one structured term held to its clause's list: { field, value, unit } with value a number
// (from "30", "1,000,000", "2x") where the unit is one, else short text; null when the field isn't on the list, the
// unit isn't one of its own (none given: only a one-unit field takes its unit) or the value is empty.

